# Flopsie, Bumi's Buddy: the limit is Flopsie's ability and lasts only while she is on the battlefield (CR 113.1a, 611.3): Bot2 destroys her with Terror on
# turn 2, so Giant Growth on turn 3 makes Llanowar Elves a 5/5 that both of Bot2's Ornithopters may block (the counter Flopsie put on it stays).
